BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intro to Mind series with Dana
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260514T070000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260514T074500
UID:450ad86c216ec11ba5e208c0cbbad8b1@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Intro to Mind (ITM): A 9-Week Meditation Series with Dana This
  nine-week mind science series invites you to slow down\, notice\, and ste
 ady your mind — especially in the face of uncertainty. Together\, we’l
 l explore meditation in a practical\, approachable way. Each week explores
  simple tools you can use in daily life — when sitting\, moving\, and co
 nnecting with others. Over nine weeks\, we’ll also explore how water\, f
 ood\, sleep\, music\, movement\, stillness\, community\, and meditation sh
 ape how we live and how we experience the world — in a supportive commun
 ity of fellow practitioners. The series is divided into three parts: Weeks
  1–3: Mind at Rest During these weeks\, we’ll focus on finding moments
  of rest and steadiness in the space between thoughts and in the face of s
 ensations and emotions — especially when life feels busy or uncertain.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:70+ Resistance Band Strength Training
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260514T100000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260514T104500
UID:1fa3f10b1ce3e371bc1f49ae0f04013b@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:This 45-minute resistance band strength class is for adults 70
 + who want to build strength\, improve balance\, and stay active in a supp
 ortive\, small-group setting. Classes focus on simple\, low-impact movemen
 ts that support everyday mobility and confidence. Exercises are adaptable 
 and meet participants where they are. Resistance bands are provided or you
 ’re welcome to bring your own. Please wear comfortable clothing\, stable
  shoes\, and bring a water bottle. Thursdays at 10:00 AM at Wellness Colle
 ctive $10 per class To sign up\, text Susette at 435-260-2523. Or show up!
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
